{"3367810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cemetery Simulator", "steam_appid": 3367810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4839060], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kickstart your cemetery business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a cemetery manager and run the most profitable necropolis around! Cemetery Simulator is a game that pulls you in from your first gravedigger: you clean, expand the area, and organize funerals. Gather prestige, unlock new sectors, face ghosts and vandals, and in 4-player co-op mode, maneuvering the coffin together turns into a real laughter festival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/6da8fe7a5390cc2acc064b1ac8f6cfd9.poster.avif?t=1782117264\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/6da8fe7a5390cc2acc064b1ac8f6cfd9.webm?t=1782117264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/6da8fe7a5390cc2acc064b1ac8f6cfd9.mp4?t=1782117264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, decorate, and earn prestige</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cemetery, your rules. You have full creative freedom: buy new tombstones in the shop, plant greenery, set up decorations, and build chapels. Every decoration increases the region's prestige, which is the key to success. The higher the prestige and the more missions completed, the faster you unlock new, mysterious sectors and expand your cemetery empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/e8e5604d7c13a52083d2caf7980a9cd1.poster.avif?t=1782117264\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/e8e5604d7c13a52083d2caf7980a9cd1.webm?t=1782117264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/e8e5604d7c13a52083d2caf7980a9cd1.mp4?t=1782117264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grab a shovel and dig in</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funeral orders are at the heart of gameplay, and rewards increase with customer satisfaction. The burial itself is a real adventure: dig the grave, carry the coffin, lower it, and cover it with earth. Then place the tombstone, engrave any inscription you want, and arrange items like lanterns, benches, and shrubs in an orderly manner! Over time, you'll unlock new services, such as cremations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/c39539714b6d7c481f57ab10600b1813.poster.avif?t=1782117264\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/c39539714b6d7c481f57ab10600b1813.webm?t=1782117264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/c39539714b6d7c481f57ab10600b1813.mp4?t=1782117264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brooms, trash, and exorcisms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between funeral orders, you keep things tidy: mow the grass, scrub monuments, make repairs, and collect trash into bags for the dumpster. But this peaceful routine can suddenly be interrupted by unpredictable events. Expect confrontations with vandals, thieves, and after dark - grab a flashlight and battle hauntings during mini-exorcisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/dbd6e9713b34385f13135b253e4c96c4.poster.avif?t=1782117264\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/dbd6e9713b34385f13135b253e4c96c4.webm?t=1782117264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/dbd6e9713b34385f13135b253e4c96c4.mp4?t=1782117264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many hands make light coffins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real fun begins in co-op mode! A shared wallet makes it easy to divide tasks—from scrubbing graves to handling orders. Thanks to the physics system, work in the cemetery becomes a festival of comedic situations. Players can splash each other with water, whack each other with shovels, or throw trash bags, sparking waves of laughter and making the game an ideal choice for group nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kickstart your cemetery business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a cemetery manager and run the most profitable necropolis around! Cemetery Simulator is a game that pulls you in from your first gravedigger: you clean, expand the area, and organize funerals. Gather prestige, unlock new sectors, face ghosts and vandals, and in 4-player co-op mode, maneuvering the coffin together turns into a real laughter festival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/extras/6da8fe7a5390cc2acc064b1ac8f6cfd9.poster.avif?t=1782117264\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src