stival of comedic situations. Players can splash each other with water, whack each other with shovels, or throw trash bags, sparking waves of laughter and making the game an ideal choice for group nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Carry the coffin with your crew and build the best necropolis! Dig graves, lower coffins, and keep everything tidy. Decorate the area to earn the prestige needed to unlock new sectors. Play solo or in co-op mode for up to 4 players, facing vandals and ghosts!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/e2c009ee6ebae21da7a39d87d248d75ec26a5666/header.jpg?t=1782117264", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/259cb2a202316badd01aafca5430f8efc55d0ba2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782117264", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367810/259cb2a202316badd01aafca5430f8efc55d0ba2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782117264", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 (6 GB) / Radeon RX 5500 XT (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> LOW Quality / 60FPS / 1920x1080. An internet connection is required for multiplayer.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Proce